e="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134782817.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The World Health Organization has set forth a comprehensive research agenda for the upcoming decade, focusing on pivotal health conditions such as stroke, mental health, cancer, and reproductive health. The extensive report points out significant underfunding in these areas, especially stroke and mental health. India expresses its support for this initiative, embracing traditional medicine to enhance the evidence necessary for the integration of these practices in healthcare.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-puts-stroke-cancer-mental-health-on-10-year-traditional-medicine-research-agenda/articleshow/134782817.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-puts-stroke-cancer-mental-health-on-10-year-traditional-medicine-research-agenda/articleshow/134782817.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T12:31:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134782866,imgsize-79854.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Can a picture make healthy food irresistible to teens?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/can-a-picture-make-healthy-food-irresistible-to-teens/articleshow/134782728.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134782728.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/can-a-picture-make-healthy-food-irresistible-to-teens/articleshow/134782728.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/can-a-picture-make-healthy-food-irresistible-to-teens/articleshow/134782728.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T12:28:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134782728,imgsize-1024737.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Slap’ row: Delhi HC seeks Parvesh Verma, police response on plea for independent probe]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/slap-row-delhi-hc-seeks-parvesh-verma-police-response-on-plea-for-independent-probe/articleshow/134782154.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134782154.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/slap-row-delhi-hc-seeks-parvesh-verma-police-response-on-plea-for-independent-probe/articleshow/134782154.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/slap-row-delhi-hc-seeks-parvesh-verma-police-response-on-plea-for-independent-probe/articleshow/134782154.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T12:00:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134782154,imgsize-94184.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Inappropriate': BJP turns heat on Rahul Gandhi over 'clash' with female Delhi cop during anti-CEC protest]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inappropriate-bjp-turns-heat-on-rahul-gandhi-over-clash-with-female-delhi-cop-during-anti-cec-protest/articleshow/134781680.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134781680.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP leaders escalated attacks on Rahul Gandhi following his protests against the Election Commission. C R Kesavan accused Gandhi of inappropriate behavior toward a female police officer during the protest. Nitin Nabin labeled Gandhi as having an anarchist mindset and suggested he resign if he disagrees with the Election Commission. The Congress party has expressed demands for Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar’s resignation over recent decisions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inappropriate-bjp-turns-heat-on-rahul-gandhi-over-clash-with-female-delhi-cop-during-anti-cec-protest/articleshow/134781680.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inappropriate-bjp-turns-heat-on-rahul-gandhi-over-clash-with-female-delhi-cop-during-anti-cec-protest/articleshow/134781680.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T11:37:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134781740,imgsize-73660.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Left lasting imprint': PM Modi visits LK Advani on completing 25 years as head of govt]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/left-lasting-imprint-pm-modi-visits-lk-advani-on-completing-25-years-as-head-of-govt/articleshow/134781153.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134781153.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/left-lasting-imprint-pm-modi-visits-lk-advani-on-completing-25-years-as-head-of-govt/articleshow/134781153.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/left-lasting-imprint-pm-modi-visits-lk-advani-on-completing-25-years-as-head-of-govt/articleshow/134781153.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-08T11:26:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134781236,imgsize-111992.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Alert, ready’: IAF chief AP Singh hails combat speed durin